Package: nova-c-desktop
Version: 0.2.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nova-C OS <novacore.iq@gmail.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: nova-c-archive-keyring, nova-c-driver-manager, unattended-upgrades, plasma-workspace, kwin-wayland, sddm, breeze, plymouth, plymouth-label, initramfs-tools, papirus-icon-theme, fonts-noto-core, fonts-inter, fonts-firacode, fastfetch, zram-tools, earlyoom
Description: Nova-C OS desktop defaults, branding and tuning
 The Nova-C look (dark slate + cyan Plasma theme, Inter font, top bar + dock layout, wallpapers,
 login screen, boot menu and splash), OS identity (os-release), memory tuning (zram-friendly sysctl,
 fewer autostarted services, no blur effects, file indexer off) and automatic
 background updates from Debian security and the Nova-C OS repository.
 Updating this package updates every installed Nova-C OS system.
